==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|s|a}}

===Etymology===
A causative verb, derived from the verb {{term|sammua||lang=fi}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈsɑmːut̪ːɑːˣ]|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|sam|mut|taa|lang=fi}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}
{{context|transitive|lang=fi}} 

# to [[put out]], [[extinguish]] {{qualifier|fire}}
# to [[quench]], extinguish {{qualifier|thirst}}
# to [[shut down]], [[turn off]]
#: ''Muista '''sammuttaa''' kone ennen kuin lähdet.''
#:: Remember to '''shut down''' the machine before you leave.

